<title>USA: PHLX to list options on American Business.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list options on American Business.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said on Friday it would list options on American Business Information Inc on September 18.</p>
<p>The exchange said American Business options will have initial expiration months of October, November, January and April and opening strike prices of 12-1/2, 15 and 17-1/2.</p>
<p>The stock was down 1/8 at 16-1/8 Friday afternoon.</p>
<p>Gateway Partners will be the specialist, the PHLX said.</p>
<p>--Chicago derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
